    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "The size-ladder source as a frozen pre-2016 static tree: a IIIF Image API 2 level0 service whose derivatives were all generated with the `native` quality that 2.1 later deprecated. The renderer asks every version 2 service for `default`, because 2.1 requires it and a 2.0 document is indistinguishable from a 2.1 one — and for a size ladder every rung shares that quality parameter, so getting it wrong is not a blurrier canvas but every rung 404ing and the canvas blank for the life of the page. The fake service in scripts/iiifFixturePlugin.mjs answers 404 for any quality but `native`, so the one-request-per-service fallback is what makes this fixture render at all."
        ]
    },
    "items": [
        {
            "id": "/demo-manifests/level0-sizes-v2/canvas/one",
